  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen community and organisational capacities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will contribute to resilience and recovery from the COVID-19 pandemic and its impacts for communities in Southern Cauca, Colombia, an area that is still impacted by the ongoing armed conflict, which along with climate emergency has led to food insecurity. The project seeks to work with 80 households to improve economic security and food sovereignty and nutrition, including through income generating initiatives linked to local markets.
The project also contributes to strengthening humanitarian capacities of the partner (2026-7).</narrative>
  </description>
